#: ../../reference/commands-and-configuration.md:30
msgid ""
"Examples of product controls include `CADRUMO_LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT`, `CADRUMO_SECRET_STORE_BACKEND`, "
"`CADRUMO_SECRET_STORE_DIR`, and `CADRUMO_OUTPUT_LANGUAGE`. `CADRUMO_SECRET_PASSPHRASE` remains a separately governed "
"programmatic-substrate setting; the CLI does not read it as an operator secret-input fallback. Use the explicit leaf "
"`--secrets-stdin` / `--secrets-fd` pair or root `--profile-secrets-stdin` / `--profile-secrets-fd` pair described in "
"[Protect access to your data](../how-to/protect-data-access.md#run-without-a-passphrase-prompt). Live `aeat config "
"--help` and its leaf help define operator-facing configuration. The [configuration map](../cli/config.rst) groups "
"those commands. Python fields are listed in the generated Cadrumo application programming interface "
"([API](../api/cadrumo.rst))."
msgstr ""
"Ejemplos de controles del producto son `CADRUMO_LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT`, `CADRUMO_SECRET_STORE_BACKEND`, "
"`CADRUMO_SECRET_STORE_DIR`, `CADRUMO_SECRET_PASSPHRASE` y `CADRUMO_OUTPUT_LANGUAGE`. La ayuda en vivo `aeat config "
"--help` y la de sus hojas definen la configuración de cara al operador. Usa los pares explícitos `--secrets-stdin` / "
"`--secrets-fd` o `--profile-secrets-stdin` / `--profile-secrets-fd` descritos en [Proteger el acceso a tus "
"datos](../how-to/protect-data-access.md#run-without-a-passphrase-prompt). El [mapa de configuración](../cli/config.rst)"
" agrupa esos comandos. Los campos de Python se enumeran en la interfaz de programación de aplicaciones de Cadrumo "
"generada ([API](../api/cadrumo.rst))."

#: ../../reference/commands-and-configuration.md:44
msgid ""
"Former product-owned `AEAT_*` state controls are not aliases for `CADRUMO_*`. Authority-owned `AEAT_*` integration "
"controls remain valid only when they name the external authority boundary."
msgstr ""
"Los antiguos controles de estado `AEAT_*` propios del producto no son alias de `CADRUMO_*`. Los controles de "
"integración `AEAT_*` propios de la autoridad siguen siendo válidos solo cuando nombran el límite con la autoridad "
"externa."
